Divide all bam files into 7 groups, run 15 at a time. Take around 22 hours each, do it in array job.

ls /scratch/fm2371/Winchell/SLF_spring23/SLF_spring23/BAMFILES/BAMFILES/Group_1/*.bam > bam_files.txt
