# 5. GenomicsDBImport
Take very long time, around 5 days
So, instead of creating an interval list with chromosomes, I created an interval list with the contigs. 
“GATK GenomicsDBImport also allows you to specify a contig or a list of contigs as intervals.”
I created the list of contigs from the reference genome, 1000 per list, three lists. 
This contigs list can be used with the `-L` flag. Then run `GenomicsDBImport` separately for each of these files. 
After running `GenomicsDBImport` on all batches, I'll have one GenomicsDB for all your samples, which can then be used for joint genotyping.

#!/bin/bash

